  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat the oven to 425°F (220°C).",
    "2. Cut the cabbage into wedges and place them on a baking sheet.",
    "3. In a small bowl, mix together the chopped zinger, butter, and ground roast.",
    "4. Brush the zinger butter mixture onto the cabbage wedges.",
    "5. Roast the cabbage in the preheated oven for 20-25 minutes, or until tender and caramelized.",
    "6. Serve hot and enjoy!"
